  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_s02",
  "title": "一束哀悼",
  "storyCode": "TW-S-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_sub-1-2_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "db8910beadbf4c78534a4d1f6ea380e648c143232bed082e4bdc5678f4342b48",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 支线2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstrongpoint"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泥岩，他們在追捕剩下的逃犯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但他們本來完全可以讓逃犯在這片群山中自生自滅，抓回去，是救了他們的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓人分不清他們是好心還是殘忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有跟來的人都和我們關係不大，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "儘量避開他們的搜查，我們要在入冬之前離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經很冷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開這裡，去哪兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們流浪了這麼久，到頭來呢？永遠不會有好結果的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那麼，我們回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們回去，找一片安靜的樹林，我們在那裡生存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們要的鬥爭呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先暫且......活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活下去，只是為了活下去，我們就在和這片大地抗爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們要去哪兒？回家？什麼家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們呢？我們不是薩卡茲，那裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們，是薩卡茲的同伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾之外的地方也許容不下薩卡茲，但卡茲戴爾，容得下你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這並不是因為寬容，而是因為那裡早已......一無所有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾......不是一座城的名字，也不能算是國家的名稱，嚴格來說，卡茲戴爾只是一個地區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一片不被允許建立家園的流亡者們的土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡......是所有無家可歸之人的歸宿。是所有無根之人的歸宿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你們的歸宿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許在那個遍地都是薩卡茲感染者的卡茲戴爾，我們反而能安安穩穩地生活下去吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞對感染者的溫和態度終歸只是血統和源石技藝普及的副產物，並不代表他們真的願意接納你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撕下遊刃有餘的面具之後，第一個遭到排斥的，還是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不光是礦石病，這個繁榮的國家已經遺忘了那些真正悲慘的角落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沃倫姆德這樣的悲劇......不過是貴族們嘔氣的幌子，是銀行家和宮廷藝術家們茶餘飯後的話題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......不能接受。也不想接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開就離開吧，我們去卡茲戴爾，去你們的故鄉看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞會不會找我們麻煩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許吧......無論前因後果如何，一批薩卡茲感染者出現在了一座被毀的城鎮，我們會成為罪魁禍首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林知道真相，他難道會栽贓給我們......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這只是他的行事方式......根據他知道的情報，做出對城鎮損害最小的判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們必須得快點離開這裡，不然的話，我們會遭到萊塔尼亞官方的通緝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，所以才需要儘早規劃路線......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，等我一會，我還要去個地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一會就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞葉幹員......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不用起身，我不會靠你太近的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在等人，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動事件發生的時候我並不在羅德島本艦......你似乎，變了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和傳聞中相比，給人的感覺有很大的不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳聞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說你和一位精英幹員並肩作戰，在龍門解決了很多事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只是一隻到處撒血的魯莽大貓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也沒能......解決任何事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要再說一次謝謝，如果沒有你和小麗薩在，我不知道事情會變成什麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島也好，塞弗林也好，哪怕是那個整合運動也好，明明沒有人希望事情變成這一步......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像所有人都在阻攔著慘劇發生，但它依舊勢不可擋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托她......她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用勉強自己感慨什麼，事情已經過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只願逝者安息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們沒能將兇手繩之以法，不僅如此，我們甚至沒能保護好安托保護過的這座城鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托她會怪我的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有你會怪罪你自己，安托小姐是個開朗的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我想她會拍拍你的肩膀，然後陪你喝到爛醉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......也是啦，原來你們很熟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和那個陪她喝到爛醉的“精英幹員”很熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......放棄追究這一切的人，不止我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你果然來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是，新摘的野花......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你應該清楚眼下的狀況，清掃任務已經接近尾聲，而羅德島近期就會離開這裡，試著聯絡資源調度進行援助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但到那時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有人會為我們說話，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不會怪塞弗林。他只能這麼向貴族們彙報，否則要遭殃的是他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會儘快離開這裡，很快。只是，這裡還有我們死去的同伴......我不想不辭而別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......八名感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，沃倫姆德死傷的人數，可比“八名”多上幾百倍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......這不是你的問題......我沒有在責難你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在反思，反思到底是什麼讓事情變成這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然知道這片大地可不是做好事有好報這麼天真，但我也......很少見過這種，這種自我毀滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被煽動的怒火和復仇欲差點摧毀了一切......連我自己也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還是在自責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......我已經冷靜下來了。我只是在想，也許不是“沒做好”，而是“做不到”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島一直以來......凱爾希醫生教導我的......我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——沒人做得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我阻止過他們過激的行徑，但一兩次阻止並不能澆滅他們復仇的怒火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......事情還是變成了這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你接下來要怎麼做？“整合運動”仍舊是大部分人的眼中釘，你應該徹底拋棄這個標誌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對......但“整合運動”並沒有消亡，這一消息已經在萊塔尼亞的感染者間傳開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抗爭的火種延續了下去......儘管它，扭曲變形。而我們也必須稍作喘息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的隊伍裡有太多不是戰士的人，我不能擅自幫他們決定他們的命運......他們也許，只是想平靜地生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了......羅德島，你們聽說過大鮑勃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有什麼關聯的話，我可以去調查檔案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒有，只是我的一個朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動？還是薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——整合運動。他是一個經驗豐富的賞金獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不是戰士，所以，他們有理由脫身......他們應當從壓迫中喘口氣，去哥倫比亞拓荒的隊伍裡尋找一席之地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......想起來了，他們還有啤酒花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你見過啤酒花嗎？那是怎麼用的？啤酒是用植物做成的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，是種很棒的植物......啤酒的泡沫應該和它有關，啊，好像還能延長防腐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不，我們真的要認真解釋這個嗎？我不是專業的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......反正很有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣......真羡慕啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啤酒花......泡沫......啤酒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別想著啤酒出神了，喂。我們好歹也是敵對的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們好歹身份有別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們，是戰士。薩卡茲們，是戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不說......很難從你的言行裡感受到你作為戰士的堅決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們別無選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們有什麼訴求，有什麼需要伸張的信念，有什麼必須保護的對象，我們只能戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止有戰鬥可以解決問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼......我們犧牲的同伴如何是好？靠和平的主張，那些壞人就會把家園和城市為我們準備好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......我們只能戰鬥下去......為了幫助感染者同胞們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“感染者同胞”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們能去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾，那可不是個好地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也不是什麼好夥計，羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真正的“好地方”，是容不下我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有另一個選擇，泥岩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......現在，還不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些萊塔尼亞人，這些薩卡茲，他們都有自己的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怨憤並沒有消去，沒有什麼可以讓他們輕易相信他人，只有團結在一起活下去的意志，才把他們凝聚在一起。僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，羅德島的燕子，也許我們還會再見的......為了感染者而戰的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你不是第一個這麼稱呼我的整合運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我離開這裡後，我們，依舊是敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則萊塔尼亞會懷疑你們，你們無法順利脫身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......就不要和敵人關係太過密切了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是來獻一束花，既然花已經帶到，我......也該走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祝你們好運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你還有什麼話想說，趁現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，就像做了一個噩夢，看他走遠之後，我突然覺得，夢醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣就......結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是很會安慰人，不過——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，其實知道你的事情，不該是你來安慰我的......對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們只能讓悲痛結束......這不是什麼好事，這是妥協，為了繼續活下去的妥協。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你花了多久接受這種心情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很久。久到足以失去更多的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......接下來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回羅德島去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......帶安托回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
